{
  "statement": "The Safety dimension is paramount for the Autonomous Driving System, ensuring that safety mechanisms are robust and effective. Requirement SAF-01 establishes a multi-layer safety architecture for comprehensive hazard mitigation. SAF-02 mandates a Minimal Risk Maneuver within 5 seconds, crucial for fault tolerance. SAF-03 ensures continuous ODD monitoring, while SAF-04 and SAF-05 prioritize passenger comfort and vehicle stability during operations. SAF-06 guarantees quick handling of obstacles, and SAF-07 allows for an emergency protocol to relax smoothness constraints when necessary. This flexibility is essential for maintaining safety during critical maneuvers.",
