      "ids": ["SAF-02", "EFF-03"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Both SAF-02 and EFF-03 require executing Minimal Risk Maneuvers within 5 seconds, leading to potential prioritization conflicts between safety and performance."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-04", "EFF-07"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "SAF-04's requirement to minimize jerk during maneuvers may conflict with EFF-07's emphasis on prioritizing smoothness during emergency maneuvers, affecting safety."
    },
